---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Terms & Conditions — RailKM';
const description =
	'Terms and conditions for using RailKM: distance-accuracy disclaimer, fare-estimate disclaimer, acceptable use, intellectual property, data attribution and limitation of liability.';
const lastUpdated = '17 October 2026';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} backHref="/" backLabel="Back to Route Mapper">
	<div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pt-12 pb-24 sm:px-6 sm:pt-16">
		<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="data-mono text-eyebrow uppercase text-muted">
			<ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
				<li><a class="focus-ring rounded-sm transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/">Home</a></li>
				<li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
				<li class="text-foreground">Terms &amp; Conditions</li>
			</ol>
		</nav>

		<p class="mt-8 data-mono text-eyebrow font-medium uppercase text-muted">Legal</p>
		<h1 class="mt-5 text-balance text-heading-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 text-body-lg text-muted">
			These terms govern your use of RailKM. By using the site you agree to them.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-3 data-mono text-eyebrow uppercase text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

		<div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-8">
			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					By accessing or using RailKM you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree,
					please do not use the service.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">2. Use of the service</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					RailKM is provided for personal and professional trip planning. You agree not to misuse
					the service, including by attempting to disrupt it, scrape it at a rate that degrades
					availability, or republish its results as official Indian Railways data.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">3. Distance accuracy disclaimer</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					Distances shown are the shortest <em>track</em> route by total kilometres, derived from
					open timetable data. They are indicative reference values and may differ slightly from
					published timetables, train-specific routes or official figures. Distances are not a
					guarantee of any particular train's route.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">4. Fare estimates disclaimer</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					Fare figures are approximate estimates based on standard Indian Railways distance
					slabs. Actual fares vary by train type, class, distance slab, dynamic pricing, reservation
					charges, superfast surcharges and GST. Fare estimates are for planning only and are not a
					quote.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">5. No affiliation</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					RailKM is an independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by
					Indian Railways, IRCTC or any government body. RailKM does not sell tickets or provide
					live train status.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">6. No warranty</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					The service is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind,
					express or implied, including accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose or
					uninterrupted availability.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">7. Limitation of liability</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					To the maximum extent permitted by law, RailKM and its maintainers are not liable for any
					direct, indirect, incidental or consequential loss arising from use of, or reliance on,
					the service or its results.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">8. Data attribution</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					Railway data is derived from open timetable data published by
					<a class="focus-ring rounded-sm text-link transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="https://datameet.org/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">DataMeet</a>.
					Attribution remains with the original data providers.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">9. Intellectual property</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					The RailKM name, interface, design and code are protected. You may use the results for
					personal and professional planning, but may not copy or redistribute the service's code
					or branding without permission.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">10. Changes to these terms</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the service after changes
					are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="border-t border-line pt-6">
				<h2 class="text-heading-md font-semibold text-foreground">11. Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-body-md text-muted">
					For questions about these terms, email
					<a class="focus-ring rounded-sm text-link transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="mailto:support@railkm.com">support@railkm.com</a>
					or use the <a class="focus-ring rounded-sm text-link transition-colors hover:text-foreground" href="/contact">contact page</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
